/*******************************************************************************
 *                 Register Abstraction
  Core Register contain:
  - Core Register
  - Core NVIC Register
  - Core SCB Register
  - Core SysTick Register
  - Core Debug Register
  - Core MPU Register
  - Core FPU Register
